IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `sssa-nouns`
IMPORT `sssa-part1-preliminary`
IMPORT `sssa-part3-administration`

-- Tests for sssa-part3-administration.l4 (ss 8 to 10).  Every expected value is
-- written from the text of the provision, beside the assertion, before the run.
-- A record is built positionally with OF; the ruler above each block names the
-- fields in their declared order.  Amounts and numbers that regulations or the
-- facts would supply are stand-ins invented for the test.

§ `Tests -- Part 3`

§§ `The ceiling of a penalty`
-- fields:                                                                   greatest fine in dollars, greatest imprisonment in months    fine, months
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 5000 12 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 4999 11 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 0 0 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 5000 0 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 0 12 EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 5001 12 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 5000 13 EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `a sentence is within the ceiling of a penalty` (Penalty OF 5000, 12) 5001 13 EQUALS FALSE

§§ `s 8(1) and (2) the Minister's direction and the duty to comply`
-- (a): certified, means information, necessary -> the Minister may direct.
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Not certified, not means information, not necessary, or not known: outside the grant.
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` FALSE (JUST TRUE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE (JUST FALSE) TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE NOTHING TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE (JUST TRUE) FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b): a direction exists -> the department is to comply; none -> not answered.
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(b) the department or authority must comply with the direction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(1)(b) the department or authority must comply with the direction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- (2)(a) and (2)(b): the same, for confidential information other than means information.
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(a) the Minister may direct the department or authority to provide the information` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(b) the department or authority must comply with the direction` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(2)(b) the department or authority must comply with the direction` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 8(3) the opt-out bar`
-- inputs: act, opted out, authorised person notified, individual has consented.
-- act: accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `accessing means information about the individual obtained under section 8(1)` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- act: using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `using or disclosing under section 9 means information about the individual that was previously accessed` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- any other act is not spoken of, whatever the opt-out, notice or consent.
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `any other act` TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `any other act` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `any other act` FALSE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(3) the authorised person is barred from the act` `any other act` TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 8(4) immunities`
-- (a): disclosing in accordance with a direction, and section 8(3) does not bar the act.
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(a) the person is not guilty or liable merely by disclosing in accordance with the direction` TRUE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(a) the person is not guilty or liable merely by disclosing in accordance with the direction` TRUE (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(a) the person is not guilty or liable merely by disclosing in accordance with the direction` TRUE NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(a) the person is not guilty or liable merely by disclosing in accordance with the direction` FALSE (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING

-- (b): fields: officer, authorised person, good faith, reasonable care, accesses, discloses to another officer, that officer is authorised, means information under 8(1), confidential information under 8(2), duties

-- (b) accesses
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) discloses to another authorised person
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (b) discloses to an officer who is not an authorised person
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) neither accesses nor discloses
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not an authorised person
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not an officer
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not in good faith
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) without reasonable care
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not means information under 8(1)
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) confidential information under 8(2), which (b) does not speak of
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) not in the performance of the duties
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) section 8(3) bars the act
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (b) whether section 8(3) bars the act is not known
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(b) the authorised person is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the means information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c): the same fields; any officer, confidential information under 8(2)
-- (c) accesses; no need to be an authorised person
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) discloses to another officer, who need not be an authorised person
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- (c) means information under 8(1), which (c) does not speak of
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) not an officer
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) not in good faith
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) without reasonable care
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) neither accesses nor discloses
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) not in the performance of the duties
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) section 8(3) bars the act
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- (c) whether section 8(3) bars the act is not known
#ASSERT `s 8(4)(c) the officer is not guilty or liable merely by accessing or disclosing the confidential information` (`Conduct of an officer of an information recipient` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 8(5) terms and conditions`
#ASSERT `s 8(5) the Minister giving the direction may impose terms and conditions regarding access` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(5) the Minister giving the direction may impose terms and conditions regarding access` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 8(6) the offence`
-- fields:                                greatest fine in dollars, greatest imprisonment in months
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the greatest penalty` EQUALS Penalty OF 5000, 12
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 0 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 0 12 EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5001 12 EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(6) the sentence is within the greatest penalty` 5000 13 EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 8(7) definitions`
-- "information recipient" means the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator.
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `the Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `a Deputy Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `an Assistant Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `a public officer or employee of a public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `a public officer acting under the direction of an administrator who is a public officer` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `a member, officer or employee of an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `an investigator` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an information recipient` `someone else` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "authorised person" means (a) the Commissioner (which s 2 extends to a Deputy or Assistant Commissioner), or (b) any other officer of an information recipient authorised by the Minister.
-- inputs: appointment under section 4, officer of an information recipient, authorised by the Minister
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `appointed under section 4(1) as the Commissioner for Silver Support` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `appointed under section 4(2)(a) as a Deputy Commissioner for Silver Support` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `appointed under section 4(2)(b) as an Assistant Commissioner for Silver Support` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `not appointed under section 4` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `not appointed under section 4` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `not appointed under section 4` FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an authorised person` `not appointed under section 4` FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- "officer", in relation to an information recipient: five kinds of recipient, six kinds of relation.
-- recipient: a Commissioner who is a public officer
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `the recipient itself` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `a public officer acting under the recipient's direction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `an employee of the same public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `a member, officer or employee of the administrator` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is a public officer` `no relation the Act names` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- recipient: a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `the recipient itself` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `a public officer acting under the recipient's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `an employee of the same public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `a member, officer or employee of the administrator` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `a Commissioner who is an employee of a public authority` `no relation the Act names` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- recipient: the Board as recipient
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `the recipient itself` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `a public officer acting under the recipient's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `an employee of the same public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the administrator` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `the Board as recipient` `no relation the Act names` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- recipient: an administrator who is a public officer as recipient
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `the recipient itself` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `a public officer acting under the recipient's direction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `an employee of the same public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the administrator` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator who is a public officer as recipient` `no relation the Act names` EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- recipient: an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `the recipient itself` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `a public officer acting under the recipient's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `an employee of the same public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `a member, officer or employee of the administrator` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 8(7) the person is an officer in relation to the information recipient` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board as recipient` `no relation the Act names` EQUALS JUST FALSE

§§ `s 9(1) to whom section 9 applies`
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `the Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `a Deputy Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `an Assistant Commissioner for Silver Support` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `an administrator who is a public officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `a public officer or employee of a public authority acting under the Commissioner's direction` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `a public officer acting under the direction of an administrator who is a public officer` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `a member, officer or employee of an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `an investigator` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 9(1) section 9 applies to the person` `someone else` EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 9(2) use or disclosure without consent`
-- fields: information obtained under 8(1) or 8(2), without consent, purpose is the administration or enforcement of the Act, purpose is the administration of the Scheme
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the purpose is one the subsection names` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the purpose is one the subsection names` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the purpose is one the subsection names` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the purpose is one the subsection names` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS FALSE
-- information outside the subsection
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- information outside the subsection, and with consent
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- with the individual's consent
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- with consent and without a purpose: consent is outside the subsection
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- no purpose the subsection names: not authorised
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- a named purpose: 'only if' does not say authorised
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- a named purpose: 'only if' does not say authorised
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING
-- both purposes: 'only if' does not say authorised
#ASSERT `s 9(2) the use or disclosure is authorised` (`Use or disclosure asked about under section 9(2)` OF TRUE, TRUE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS NOTHING

§§ `s 9(3) a report for a prescribed public scheme`
-- inputs: provider, derived information, prescribed scheme (MAYBE), at the request of the recipient, Minister approved, in the form of a report, report states (i), report states (ii)
-- every limb met, by each kind of provider
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `the Commissioner for Silver Support` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `a Deputy Commissioner for Silver Support` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `an Assistant Commissioner for Silver Support` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `the Board` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `an administrator who is a public officer` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `an administrator that is a public authority other than the Board` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- a provider the subsection does not name
#ASSERT `s 9(3) the Commissioner, the Board or an administrator may provide the information` `a member, officer or employee of the Board` TRUE (JUST TRUE) TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
