#ASSERT `s 9(7) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) (JUST TRUE) EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `s 9(7) the person is guilty of an offence` (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) (JUST FALSE) EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 9(7) the person is guilty of an offence` NOTHING NOTHING NOTHING EQUALS NOTHING
